===================================================================

Python / Django

===================================================================

# Virtual Environment (never commit this)
venv/
/venv/

# Python cache files
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local development database
db.sqlite3
db.sqlite3-journal

# Environment variables (SECRET KEYS, passwords)
.env
.env.*
*.env

# User-uploaded files
/media/

# Collected static files
/static/

# AI Model files (if any)
*.joblib
*.pth

===================================================================

Node.js / React / Vite (if frontend present)

===================================================================

# Dependency directories
node_modules/
/node_modules/
/frontend/node_modules/

# Build output
dist/
/frontend/dist/

# Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
*.log

===================================================================

# IDE / OS specific files

===================================================================

# VS Code workspace data
.vscode/
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json

# macOS
.DS_Store
